 # Changelog
 
 All notable changes to the `harness-bootstrap` package. See `references/00-overview.md` for the full package description and versioning rules (patch/minor/major, same as `skill-authoring.md`'s "Bootstrap template versioning").
+
+## 7.5.0
+
+Dev canonical skill 2.2.0 → 2.3.0. Canonical source update; installed project copies
+are updated separately through patch apply.
+
+- Consolidate all dev review findings into one stable-ID ledger; keep linked Tech
+  Debt for owner, next action and optional tracker creation. HLD-only deviation
+  auditing sends routine LLD lag directly to documentation updates.
+- Replace phase/file/fix confirmation loops with shared decision and authorization
+  boundaries. Reuse existing authorization, prepare concrete decisions, and retain
+  project guarded commands and required human verification.
+- Require evidence-backed terminal findings, checked docs and passing required
+  verification before archival. Full-flow tracker completion has one owner.
+- Add report-derived quality inventory to optional v2 stat.json quality: finding kind,
+  deviation type, severity, classification, resolution, PR-origin subset, debt and
+  tests written/latest case counts. Historical failed test runs remain separate.
+  Reject malformed/duplicate records; unknown measurements remain unavailable.
+- Tests are conditional on value and project setup: unit/integration/load/other types
+  fit the work, with no mandatory test-writing Step 1. If test-first work is chosen,
+  red/green stays within one logical step compatible with the metrics completion gate.
+- Remove assumed hooks/targets and synchronize canonical lifecycle documentation.
+- Review fix: `report` now migrates the pre-split single `<!-- dev-metrics:* -->`
+  marker block in place (into the step section, mirroring the design CLI's legacy
+  handling) instead of appending new sections beside an orphaned stale block on
+  older reports.
+- Refactor `scripts/`: renamed the CLI entrypoint `dev-metrics.mjs` → `timing.mjs`
+  (its actual subject — stage/step/interval/check timing, structural validation,
+  the generated Stage/Step Metrics report sections) so the folder reads as exactly
+  two metrics-domain files, `timing.mjs` and `quality.mjs`, plus the shared
+  `constants.mjs`/`utils.mjs`. Moved `quality.mjs`'s inline constant arrays
+  (`KINDS`/`SEVERITIES`/etc.) into `constants.mjs` as `FINDING_*`, consolidating
+  every shared constant in one file. Split `timing.mjs`'s row/section building into
+  small named helpers (`metricsRow`, `metricsSection`) shared by the Stage and Step
+  tables instead of two near-duplicate inline blocks. No behavior or CLI contract
+  change — same commands, same stat.json shape, same report output (verified
+  byte-for-byte on a smoke test); `dev-metrics.test.mjs` renamed to
+  `timing.test.mjs` to match, and every path reference across `INTENT.md`,
+  `TEMPLATE.md`, and `patterns/metrics.md` updated. Report markers
+  (`dev-metrics-stage:*`/`dev-metrics-step:*`/legacy `dev-metrics:*`) keep their
+  existing names — they're a report-format concept, not tied to the script filename.
+  Dev template 2.3.0 → 2.3.1.
 
